{"sections":[{"slug":"连通-截断分解","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"连通-截断分解"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"(n-<span lang=\"zh\">连通</span>, n-<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">分解</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"(n-连通, n-截断) 分解"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Ani","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">以及一般的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对每个整数</span> $n\\geq -2$, <span lang=\"zh\">有一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/正交分解系","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">正交分解系</span>"}},{"Plain":" ($n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/连通性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">连通</span>"}},{"Plain":", $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":"). <span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">任一态射</span> $f \\colon X \\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">均可唯一地分解为</span>\n$$\r\nX \\to Z \\to Y,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$X\\to Z$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/连通性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">连通</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">映射</span>;</li>\n<li>$Z\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">映射</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">以</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/相对","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">相对观点</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">看</span>, $Z\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">就是</span> $X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">在相对于</span> $Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/俯意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">俯意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">进一步</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">所有这些分解可以连成一个序列</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/滤过","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">滤对象</span>"}},{"Plain":")\n$$\r\nX \\to \\cdots Z_n \\to Z_{n-1} \\cdots \\to Z_{-2} = Y,\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">它是相对于</span> $Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/俯意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">俯意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Postnikov塔","text":"Postnikov <span lang=\"zh\">塔</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>$n=-2$:</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">态射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> ($(-2)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/连通性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">连通</span>"}},{"Plain":", $(-2)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">分解为</span>\n$$\r\nX \\to Y \\overset{\\mathrm{id}}{\\to} Y.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/连通性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">连通性</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断性</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/正交分解系","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">正交分解系</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Postnikov塔","text":"Postnikov <span lang=\"zh\">塔</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/Whitehead塔","text":"Whitehead <span lang=\"zh\">塔</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}